*instrument WSCC DistoX1, Footleg's Dell Axim x51v PDA, PocketTopo V1.36
; Calibration: Continuation of Valley Entrance section of survey on the same trip. This is the calibration information 
; from that trip file: DistoX was calibration checked at start of trip. Back sights were taken for visual checking of 
; all legs on PDA sketch (represented by splays in this data). Magnetic steel toe caps in wellies resulted in some 
; problems with matching back shots to forward shots when feet too close to Disto. Legs were re-measured when this 
; occurred. See triangulation legs at stations 16-21 testing for problems. The DistoX was recalibrated at this point 
; due to concerns with clino calibration at this point where legs with significant slope were first measured on this
; trip.

*calibrate declination +2.21

